	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Pax domini Iesu tecum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ne egre feras, doctissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, me tuis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hactenus amicissimis literis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> non respondisse.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Pene toto hoc autumno <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>decubui infirmus nec videbatur michi occasionem dignam ad te scribe[ndi]<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Textverlust wegen Abnutzung des Randes.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>habere.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dum autem <persName ref="p8071">Voglerus</persName>, communis noster amicus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Zu <persName ref="p1387">Gaßners</persName> Freundschaft mit <persName ref="p8071">Hans Vogler</persName> vgl. Karl Heinz <hi>Burmeister,</hi> Thomas Gaßner. Ein Beitrag zur Geschichte der Reformation und des Humanismus in Lindau, Lindau 1971. -Njbl. 21 des Museumsvereins <placeName ref="l291">Lindau</placeName>, S. 30, sowie <bibl source="b5">HBBW III</bibl> <ref target="file10325">[Nr. 294]</ref>, S. 245f, Anm. 5.</note>, vir piissimus, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>revocaret ad se filium<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p6935">Hans Rudolf Vogler</persName> (vgl. <hi>Burmeister,</hi> aaO, S. 30f).</note> suum, quem commisit michi anno hoc erudiend[um]<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>Textverlust wegen Abnutzung des Randes.</hi></note>, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non potui vacuum mearum litterarum ad te dimittere, praecipue dum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>intelligo te victum illius parentis precibus in curam atque disciplinam <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sustinere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Congratulor profecto ex corde intimo puero huiusmodi <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>nactum preceptorem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Adulescens meo quidem iuditio non ineptus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>fuisset studio, si tempestivius studiis esset mancipatus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Non potuit <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>in finem audire grammaticen, cuius omnino ignarus erat, dum ad <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>me venerat; arbitror tantillo tempore non admodum male <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>profecisse; tu ipse diiudica.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="59"/><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Rerum novarum nichil ad te scribo, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>cum omnia me melius novisse te nichil addubito.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Spero conventum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l1202">Schmalckhaldie</placeName>, qui nunc congregatus est<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Die auf den 7. Februar anberaumte Bundesversammlung in <placeName ref="l1202">Schmalkalden</placeName> wurde am 10. Februar 1537 eröffnet; vgl. <bibl source="b668">Volz, Urkunden</bibl> 81. 102, Anm. 2. 146-148.</note>, multa bona allaturum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Quam primo, quid actum fuerit, perscrutatus fuero, multis ad <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>te scribam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nunc obsecro, me velis in amiciciam tuam quantumvis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>imparem admittere et pro me et ecclesia nostra suppliciter exorare <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>deum, ut omnia per nos fiant in sui nominis gloriam.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale felicissime <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et, si quando prae negotiis vacat, alteris me dignare scriptis, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut intelligere possim in amicorum tuorum album me adscriptum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>esse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l291">Lindavii</placeName>, 10. februarii anno 37.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p1387">Thomas Gasnerus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l291">Lindaviensis</placeName> ecclesie <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>minister, deditissimus tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro M. <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigur<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>inę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>antist<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>iti vig<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>domino ac <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>fratri <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>suo ob[servando]<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>Text wegen engem Einband unlesbar.</hi></note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
